{"id":"0e8be33143821f05","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-fcp.md","title":"Finite Congruence Property","display":"df-fcp — Finite Congruence Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-fcp","aliases":["93-df-fcp"],"display":"df-fcp — Finite Congruence Property","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-fcp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-fcp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fcp — Finite Congruence Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is a similarity-type candidate, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> is a class candidate, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is an algebra candidate.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> are the one-place and componentwise type predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span> is the finite-set predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}(X)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinGen}_{93}(-;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinGen}_{93}(-;\\tau)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FCP}_{93}(-;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{FCP}_{93}(-;\\tau)\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}(X)\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\">\\(X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\)</span>；不添加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(X\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span> 或生成载集非空的条件。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fcp}\\vdash\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}(X)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{B\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|:X\\subseteq B\\land\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\left(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar b\\in B^{\\alpha(f)}\\;(f^{\\mathbf A}(\\bar b)\\in B)\\right)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fcp}\\vdash\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}(X)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{B\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|:X\\subseteq B\\land\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\left(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar b\\in B^{\\alpha(f)}\\;(f^{\\mathbf A}(\\bar b)\\in B)\\right)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fcp}\\vdash\\mathrm{FinGen}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\exists X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\;(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(X)\\land\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}(X)=|\\mathbf A|)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fcp}\\vdash\\mathrm{FinGen}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\exists X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\;(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(X)\\land\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}(X)=|\\mathbf A|)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fcp}\\vdash\\mathrm{FCP}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;(\\mathrm{FinGen}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau)\\to\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fcp}\\vdash\\mathrm{FCP}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;(\\mathrm{FinGen}_{93}(\\mathbf A;\\tau)\\to\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\to\nX\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}(X)\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\to\nX\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}(X)\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The generated carrier is the least subset closed under the operations named by the displayed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>; carrier and signature parameters are now both explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数